{"scene_id": "pt_hedda_5", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_hedda_5.fountain", "heading": "INT. HEDDA - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. HEDDA - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Thanks for your lovely flowers--", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, not at all--.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "I would have come straight here yesterday afternoon; but I heard that you were away--", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Have you just come to town?", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Eh?", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "I arrived yesterday, about midday.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, I was quite in despair when I heard that you were not at home.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "In despair!", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "How so?", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Why, my dear Mrs. Rysing--I mean Mrs. Elvsted--", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "I hope that you are not in any trouble?", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, I am.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "And I don't know another living creature here that I can turn to.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "[Laying the bouquet on the table.] Come--let us sit here on the sofa--", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, I am too restless to sit down.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh no, you're not.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Come here.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "[She draws MRS. ELVSTED down upon the sofa and sits at her side.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Well?", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "What is it, Mrs. Elvsted--?", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Has anything particular happened to you at home?", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes--and no. Oh--I am so anxious you should not misunderstand me--", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Then your best plan is to tell us the whole story, Mrs. Elvsted.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "I suppose that's what you have come for--eh?", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, yes--of course it is.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Well then, I must tell you--if you don't already know--that Eilert Lovborg is in town, too.", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Lovborg--!", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "What!", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Has Eilert Lovborg come back?", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Fancy that, Hedda!", "para": 19, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Well well--I hear it.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "He has been here a week already.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Just fancy--a whole week!", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "In this terrible town, alone!", "para": 21, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "With so many temptations on all sides.", "para": 21, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "But, my dear Mrs. Elvsted--how does he concern you so much?", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "[Looks at her with a startled air, and says rapidly.] He was the children's tutor.", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Your children's?", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "My husband's.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "I have none.", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Your step-children's, then?", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "[Somewhat hesitatingly.] Then was he--I don't know how to express it--was he--regular enough in his habits to be fit for the post?", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Eh?", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "For the last two years his conduct has been irreproachable.", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Has it indeed?", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Fancy that, Hedda!", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "I hear it.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Perfectly irreproachable, I assure you!", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "In every respect.", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "But all the same--now that I know he is here--in this great town--and with a large sum of money in his hands--I can't help being in mortal fear for him.", "para": 32, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "Why did he not remain where he was?", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "With you and your husband?", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Eh?", "para": 33, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "After his book was published he was too restless and unsettled to remain with us.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, by-the-bye, Aunt Julia told me he had published a new book.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, a big book, dealing with the march of civilisation--in broad outline, as it were.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "It came out about a fortnight ago.", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "And since it has sold so well, and been so much read--and made such a sensation--", "para": 36, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Has it indeed?", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "It must be something he has had lying by since his better days.", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "Long ago, you mean?", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes.", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "No, he has written it all since he has been with us--within the last year.", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Isn't that good news, Hedda?", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "Think of that.", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah yes, if only it would last!", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "Have you seen him here in town?", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "No, not yet.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "I have had the greatest difficulty in finding out his address.", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "But this morning I discovered it at last.", "para": 44, "sent": 2, "present": []}]}